cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "eMediBlock: a secure service-oriented framework for electronic health record management using blockchain"
abstract: >-
  Smart contracts, benchmarks, attack suite and offline experiment code for the
  eMediBlock framework: epoch-fenced consent, accountable emergency access,
  batched Merkle anchoring, consent-gated erasure-coded recovery,
  standards-anchored integrity over HL7 FHIR, and congestion-aware scheduling.
